web.复测/修复/拒绝都会创建任务（固定一轮）执行；\n复测后若关联用例全部通过，bu:
Retest, fix, and reject each create a one-round task;
after a retest, if all linked cases pass, the bug status becomes "Fixed (retest passed)";
a fix task whose end stage is not Retest marks the bug "Fix complete, pending retest" when it finishes;
reject marks it "Rejected" and corrects the linked cases per the reason;
follow the fix/case-fix process live in the Conversation tab
